.org/t/p/original/y4a7O3RXVwXjzq6Ng0xl0wgYSZt.jpg"},{"id":3767318,"name":"Cetti Arancio","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sijq4meIU6zay6gQDRLx3ccXiV0.jpg"},{"id":3767319,"name":"Doriana Chierici","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)"},{"id":3767321,"name":"Adriana Angrisano","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)"},{"id":92094,"name":"Paolo De Vita","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cNMP0Dkl8WMZBbtcXJzIf4pk8D7.jpg"},{"id":1149276,"name":"Ilaria Giorgino","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8G7TEN2tRen0FsauyUFbzXKy300.jpg"},{"id":3376778,"name":"Gaetano Lizzio","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pl8gGeoJz0QUxNWITf8UU8Zr8un.jpg"},{"id":3070864,"name":"Massimiliano Plinio","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)"},{"id":2282783,"name":"Gianfranco Miranda","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qx3a5MbZwlEXgldPERmXWBI0rJ5.jpg"},{"id":1303355,"name":"Antonio Tallura","role":"Italian Emigrant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qmj5nGPttAfa2dOaMqbSzxFCeEJ.jpg"},{"id":124682,"name":"Alexia Murray","role":"American Official (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ShwobiV8u6Sg8KuC7CnV71dzeO.jpg"},{"id":1409145,"name":"Fernando Margenet","role":"Immigration Doctor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBBJWxd2jjpUQ8Rej6QevZKrkjy.jpg"},{"id":5789510,"name":"Agustín Bruzzone","role":"Italien Emigrant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9wSGFvcN6UkCz4z2kRRSfgjzux0.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Nella Sicilia degli inizi del Novecento, Salvatore fa un voto e chiede un segno al cielo: vuole imbarcarsi per il nuovomondo e condurre in America i figli e l’anziana madre. Il segnale è una cartolina di propaganda che ritrae minuscoli contadini accanto a galline giganti o a carote sproporzionate. Venduta ogni cosa posseduta, Salvatore lascia la Sicilia alla volta dell’America. Durante la traversata oceanica incontra la bella Lucy, una young lady che indossa il cappello ed è più elegante della figlia del sindaco del paese. Luce parla la lingua dell’America e cerca un compagno da impalmare per ritornarci da signora. Salvatore, da vero galantuomo, accoglie la sua avance. Il lungo viaggio approderà ad Ellis Island, l’isola della quarantena dove si decideranno gli ingressi e i rimpatri."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Golden Door","overview":"The story is set at the beginning of the 20th century in Sicily. Salvatore, a very poor farmer, and a widower, decides to emigrate to the US with all his family, including his old mother. Before they embark, they meet Lucy. She is supposed to be a British lady and wants to come back to the States. Lucy, or Luce as Salvatore calls her, for unknown reasons wants to marry someone before to arrive to Ellis Island in New York. Salvatore accepts the proposal. Once they arrive in Ellis Island they spend the quarantine period trying to pass the examinations to be admitted to the States. Tests are not so simple for poor farmers coming from Sicily. Their destiny is in the hands of the custom officers."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gLEp2J0FkzfuehEktVk8UT79w9A.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gLEp2J0FkzfuehEktVk8UT79w9A.jpg","language":"it","width":525,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gjSK4pyVDt8Pwt9KpB8OtC246DC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gjSK4pyVDt8Pwt9KpB8OtC246DC.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3peLF6wBq8TGrVblBnoa2Hw8rk6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3peLF6wBq8TGrVblBnoa2Hw8rk6.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}],"backdro